HELP_BEGIN
HELP_VERSION 1.8.9
HELP_CMD init <repo_path>
HELP_CMD status <repo_path> <find_mask> <dir_prefix>
HELP_CMD offer <repo_path> <find_mask> <message>
HELP_CMD offertree <repo_path> <dir_path> <message> (recursive, ADR 0010)
HELP_CMD merge <repo_path> <other_path_name> (a real conflict now persists - see 'conflicts'/'resolve'/'merge continue'/'merge abort', ADR 0016)
HELP_CMD merge continue <repo_path> (finish a merge once every conflict is resolved, ADR 0016)
HELP_CMD merge abort <repo_path> (discard an in-progress merge's conflicts, ADR 0016)
HELP_CMD conflicts <repo_path> (list the current path's in-progress merge conflicts, ADR 0016)
HELP_CMD resolve <repo_path> <conflict_index> take-ours|take-theirs (an absent side = resolve to deletion; ADR 0016)
HELP_CMD conflictdoc <repo_path> <dest.DD> (DolDoc view of the in-progress merge's conflicts)
HELP_CMD statustree <repo_path> <dir_path> (recursive status, ADR 0010)
HELP_CMD history <repo_path>
HELP_CMD see <repo_path> <commit_hex>
HELP_CMD diff <repo_path> <commit_hex>
HELP_CMD check <repo_path>
HELP_CMD historydoc <repo_path> <dest.DD>
HELP_CMD reconciledoc <repo_path> <commit_hex> <dest.DD>
HELP_CMD reconcileoverview <repo_path> <dest.DD>
HELP_CMD graph <repo_path> <dest.DD>
HELP_CMD correct <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <find_mask> <message>
HELP_CMD revert <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <find_mask> <message>
HELP_CMD reconcile <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <find_mask> <message>
HELP_CMD correcttree <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <dir_path> <message> (recursive, ADR 0010)
HELP_CMD reverttree <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <dir_path> <message> (recursive, ADR 0010)
HELP_CMD reconciletree <repo_path> <target_hex> <entity_hex> <dir_path> <message> (recursive, ADR 0010)
HELP_CMD   (entity_hex: 0000000000000000 for none, ADR 0006)
HELP_CMD undo <repo_path>
HELP_CMD redo <repo_path>
HELP_CMD operation history <repo_path>
HELP_CMD operation restore <repo_path> <op_index>
HELP_CMD path list <repo_path>
HELP_CMD path new <repo_path> <name>
HELP_CMD path go <repo_path> <name>
HELP_CMD path close <repo_path> <name>
HELP_CMD export <src_repo_path> <dest_repo_path>
HELP_CMD import <src_repo_path> <dest_repo_path>
HELP_CMD interactive (show hgit's output on the TempleOS screen and turn AutoComplete off - run this first when typing at the console)
HELP_CMD help
HELP_CMD version
HELP_CMD logo
HELP_END
